OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after
OL,4,Afootballer dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched following the death of a
OL,8,Ffootballer in a suspected assault.
OL,10,FEzekiel Williams, 26, from London, who
OL,11,Fplayed for Hendon FC, suffered serious
OL,12,Finjuries in the early hours of Sunday
OL,13,Fin Midsummer Boulevard in Milton
OL,14,FKeynes.
OL,16,FThames Valley Police said officers were
OL,17,Fcalled by South Central Ambulance
OL,18,FService shortly after 01:50 GMT.
OL,19,FWilliams died of his injuries in
OL,20,Fhospital on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
